1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Carl_Gustaf_Rudolf_Cederstr%C3%B6m_-_from_Svenskt_Portr%C3%A4ttgalleri_II.png
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived at Krusenberg: 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Krusenberg
2 CONT
