1 NAME Ambrosius /Westring/
2 GIVN Ambrosius
2 _MARNM Westring
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 22 NOV 1692
2 ADDR
3 CITY Öregrund
3 STAE Uppsala County
3 CTRY Sweden
