2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage in Turku Finland 21.1.1872. Died before 1882. Russian captain in marine forces.
2 CONT
2 CONT Is he a son of Roman Platonovich Boyle (1794 - 1854), a vice admiral, Russian circumnavigator etc???
