1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 24 MAY 1826
2 PLAC Hagbyberga
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Björkvik
3 CITY Katrineholm
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 27 SEP 1908
2 PLAC Almnäs
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Kärnbo
