0 @N6000000002577017182@ NOTE !SOURCES:
1 CONT 1- 9 Aug 1993: Data taken from the records of Owen B Anderson
1 CONT 2- 9 Aug 1993: IGI report
1 CONT 3- 1999: Swedish Postal address Book.
1 CONT 4- Research done by Ella Heckscher, Genialogist, Uppsulla, Sweden, in the SAvenska Adelus Altarbavlar: vol 1; p 347; #9
1 CONT
1 CONT NOTES:
1 CONT 1- See his father's note section for details on the birthplace.
1 CONT
1 CONT 2- Where the children Kronoberg county, which is in Smaland, we will use this address to start our search for birthplaces.
1 CONT
1 CONT 3- Data  on a FGR from Uncle Arthur Anderson, that was researched by Ella Hecksche,r has different parishes in Kronoberg for the birthplaces on the FGR of Carl Fredrik Berghman and Vendella Maria Rosenbjelke and family. They seem 
1 CONC to be not so vague as other FGR's, so I will use that information in the computer for this family.
1 CONT
1 CONT 4- Research done by Ella Hekscher has the birthplaces for this family in Kronoberg. The village name for Carl's birthplace of Qvickhult could not be found in the address book. There are only 2 village names starting with "Q".
