0 @N6000000002577107153@ NOTE 1- 17 Jul 1993; This data was picked up from the records of Owen B
1 CONT Anderson.
1 CONT 2-  9 Aug 1993: Ancestral File report
1 CONT
1 CONT NOTES:
1 CONT 1- I am using the parish of Tuna in Kalmar county because the the AF
1 CONT has the parish name of Tuna. The name, Malmgruva is not recognized as a
1 CONT parish. Some data was extracted from the above IGI report.
1 CONT 2- The children of this marriage all have a patronymic name and an
1 CONT established family name. They should be used combined. In Sweden, before      1800, many families of status were allowed to establish permenant             surnames. When these appear in the parish records the patonymic name      
1 CONC     should not be used. Therefore, inasmuch as the parents of this couple are     using established family surnames I will not use the partonymic name of       MANGUSSON in these records.
1 CONT 3- 1993: This report has a marriage date of 11 Apr 1737, no place
1 CONT listed.
