1 CONC        surnames. When these appear in the parish records the patonymic name          should not be used. Therfore, as the parents of this couple are using an      established family surnames I will not use the partonymic name of  
1 CONC            MANGUSSON in these records.
1 CONT 2- The daughters of this marriage are listed with patronymic names and not       the established surname.
