0 @N6000000002577107377@ NOTE !SOURCES:
1 CONT 1- From the records of A R Anderson and Annie Anderson Vancott.
1 CONT 2- 1992: From the records of Owen B Anderson.
1 CONT 3- 9 August 1993: Ancestral FGile report.
1 CONT 4- 9 Oct 1994: TempleReady file report.
1 CONT 5- Swedish Postal Address Book: Stake Family History Center.
1 CONT
1 CONT !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- On this record Malmgrufva is probably a farm or locality name. Tuna is a
1 CONT parish name in 4 different counties. Kalmar seems to be the county where      the main group of the Meurling/ Hellestjerna families lived. for this         reason I use this county when I have to make a choice. Tuna is the parish 
1 CONC     that the
1 CONT 2- 1994: The farm name "Malmgrufa" is spelled "Malmgrava" in the postal book.
1 CONT It is listed in Tuna, Kalmar, Smaland, Sweden.
1 CONT 3- 1993: This file report has the death date for Gustaf as 20 Feb 1821, no
1 CONT place listed. We had 14 March 1776. I think the date of this report is        better as he died about 1794.
1 CONT 4- January 1997: the ordinance work listed as "done" was done in the Jordon
1 CONT River temple between 17 Jul 1994 and 30 Dec 1995.
